{"ref":"BDB, אֲבֵדָה","hw":"אֲבֵדָה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אֲבֵדָה</span></big>  <strong>n.f. a lost thing</strong>—abs. except <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 22:3\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.22.3\">Dt 22:3</a> cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲבֵדַת</span>—<a data-ref=\"Exodus 22:8\" href=\"/Exodus.22.8\">Ex 22:8</a>; with <span dir=\"rtl\">מָצָא</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 5:22\" href=\"/Leviticus.5.22\">Lv 5:22</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 5:23\" href=\"/Leviticus.5.23\">23</a>; with <span dir=\"rtl\">אָבַד</span> + <span dir=\"rtl\">מָצָא</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 22:3\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.22.3\">Dt 22:3</a>;—(<span dir=\"rtl\">אבדה</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 27:20\" href=\"/Proverbs.27.20\">Pr 27:20</a> Kt cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, אֲבֵדָה\" href=\"/BDB,_אֲבֵדָה\", dir=\"rtl\">אֲבַדּוֹ</a> infr.)","next":"BDB, אֲבַדֹּה","prev":"BDB, אֹבֵד"}